ModuleDocComment 0..97 "//! A member of an impl that leaves out the types of its parameters, or its result, has them from"
Whitespace 97..98 "\n"
ModuleDocComment 98..197 "//! the requirement it implements, with the `Self` the impl is for and the `$` parameters it binds:"
Whitespace 197..198 "\n"
ModuleDocComment 198..296 "//! for a type, for the types a constructor makes, and with a `$` parameter a call infers from the"
Whitespace 296..297 "\n"
